@startuml US004-SSD
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "User" as Actor
participant "UI" as UI
participant "System" as System

activate Actor
Actor -> UI : opens today's food log
activate UI
UI -> System : getDailyLog()
activate System
System -> System : load log by authenticated user and current date
System --> UI : today's meals and nutrition progress
deactivate System
UI --> Actor : displays meals, totals, targets, and remaining values

Actor -> UI : searches/selects food using US003
UI --> Actor : displays selected food and catalog serving
Actor -> UI : adds serving quantity to meal type
UI -> System : addMealItem(foodId, mealType, servingQuantity)
activate System
System -> System : resolve food data through US003 by foodId
System -> System : load or create today's DailyLog
note right of System
  If this is the first item, snapshot the active daily targets.
  Store FoodId plus food/nutrient and serving snapshots.
end note
System -> System : add item and calculate meal/day totals
System --> UI : updated log, consumed totals, targets, remaining values
deactivate System
UI --> Actor : displays updated daily progress

deactivate UI
deactivate Actor
@enduml
